AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000232> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002323> "Do not use this relation directly. It is ended as a grouping for a diverse set of relations, all involving parthood or connectivity relationships")
