AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://dictionary.apa.org/sensation") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/EMRO/0000005> "A phenomenal cognitive experience produced by the parts of the nervous sysem involved in awarness of the external world (i.e., external stimulus) or changes internal organs associated with processes such as hunger, thirst, nausea, and sexual excitement. A sensory experience does not necessarily entail the existence phenomenon experiences (e.g., hallucinations).")
